HOW='<h2>How to enter GTA 6 cheats</h2><p>In GTA 6, cheats are entered on Jason or Lucia\'s in-game phone. Open the phone, hold <b>L1 + R1</b> on PS5 or <b>LB + RB</b> on Xbox Series X|S, then input the sequence on the D-Pad. A notification confirms the cheat. Because all codes only use the D-Pad, the sequence is identical on PlayStation and Xbox.</p><p>Cheats cannot be used during the story: the Cheats list (Progress menu &gt; Cheats) appears only after you finish it. Each cheat must then be unlocked by its own requirement (shown in the "How to unlock" column) — entering a code before that does nothing. Activating a cheat disables trophies, achievements and saving for that session — so save first. Full details in our <a href="how-to-enter-cheats.html">step-by-step guide</a>.</p>'
STAT='<h2>About the "Status" column</h2><p>Rockstar has not published an official cheat list. We cross-check every sequence against several published guides: <span class="v">Matched by 2 sources</span> means two independent guides list the exact same input, <span class="v r">Reported</span> means only one source lists it so far. If a code does not work for you, <a href="contact.html">tell us</a> and we will re-test it.</p>'
FAQ=[("Are there cheat codes in GTA 6?","Yes. GTA 6 keeps the series tradition: cheats are entered through the in-game phone with a D-Pad sequence while holding L1+R1 (PS5) or LB+RB (Xbox)."),
("Is there a money cheat in GTA 6?","A $250,000 money cheat is listed by several guides (↑ → ↓ ← ↑ ← ↓ →). Remember that cheats disable saving for the session, so the money may not be kept permanently."),
("Do GTA 6 cheats disable trophies?","Yes. Activating any cheat disables trophies and achievements as well as saving for the current session. Reload your save to play normally again."),
("Do cheats work in GTA Online?","No. Cheats only work in story mode. Mods or hacks online break Rockstar's rules and can get your account banned."),
("Is GTA 6 on PC?","GTA 6 launched on PS5 and Xbox Series X|S. No PC version has been dated yet; we will add PC cheats when it releases."),
("Why is a code not working?","Make sure you are in free roam (not in a mission or cutscene), that you hold both shoulder buttons while typing, and that you have finished the story if the cheat requires it.")]
